{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111965","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111965/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111965/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111965/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111965","id":3546160958,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6vV64I","number":111965,"title":"Make `memnew(RefCounted)` return `Ref`, to improve ownership safety","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":13,"created_at":"2025-10-23T19:04:07Z","updated_at":"2026-03-19T20:47:15Z","closed_at":"2026-03-19T20:45:06Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111965","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111965","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111965.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111965.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-19T20:45:06Z"},"body":"This PR improves `RefCounted` ownership semantics for newly created objects, preventing potential crashes and other footguns at build time.\r\n\r\n## Background\r\n\r\nWhen `memnew` initializes `RefCounted` subclasses, they start with an (effective) allocation count of 0.\r\n\r\nThis creates two ownership related problems:\r\n\r\n- When stored as `RefCounted *` initially, some code may increase and later decrease the refcount (e.g. when passing as `Variant`). This destructs the object, because the refcount is decreased to 0. The actual owner's `RefCounted *` will be a dangling pointer. The owner should have stored `Ref<RefCounted>` instead.\r\n- When in the `postinitialize_handler` / `NOTIFICATION_POSTINITIALIZE`, `RefCounted` objects still have an allocation count of 0, because the caller of `memnew` didn't claim a reference yet. If the allocation count is increased and later decreased during this function, the object will unexpectedly destruct (see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108395).\r\n\r\nThe ideal (only?) way to fix this is to start `RefCounted` with a refcount of 1. The `memnew` caller must take ownership of the refcount after the call. This just means we return `Ref` from `memnew`. Most callers already store the result in a `Ref`, so they are compatible with this change.\r\n\r\n## Overview\r\n\r\nImplementing the change was fairly straight-forward; I add and specialize `memnew_result_t` such that for `RefCounted` types, `memnew` returns `Ref<T>`.\r\n\r\nThe rest of the changes are fixing current ownership problems. Mostly, it just involves changing `T *` to `Ref<T>`. It has some inherent risk, but I don't think it's huge.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111965/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":9,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111965/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}